<p>NOTE: For the second quarter of fiscal 1997, the company recorded a pre-tax charge of $20 million or ($0.75) per share after tax, related to a strategy shift involving the liquidation of the Boston Traders product brand, closure of its New York product development office and the planned closing of 17 designs stores and 16 Boston Traders Outlet stores. The plan is expected to be completed by the end of fiscal 1998.</p>
